  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA solitary ancient figure stands on a tiny boat amidst a vast, starlit ocean, embodying the poetic insignificance of life against the cosmos. This 5-second clip utilizes a single continuous shot with a slow, majestic pull-back to reveal the scale of the environment. The sequence begins with a focus on the figure and the glowing mayflies, then expands to show the endless sea and sky merging, emphasizing the \"New Chinese Aesthetics\" of solitude and grandeur.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nNighttime open ocean environment where the sea surface mirrors the starry sky, blurring the horizon line into a seamless void. The atmosphere is thick with volumetric mist that behaves like flowing ink, creating a soft, diffused light. The water is dark teal and grey with shimmering specular highlights reflecting the starlight. Glowing particles (mayflies) float in the air, emitting a soft bioluminescent warmth against the cold background. The lighting is low-key but high-contrast, with rim lighting defining the mist and water texture.\n**Audio Description**: Deep, resonant ambient drone with subtle wind sounds and faint water lapping. A solitary, melancholic traditional string instrument (Guqin) plucks slowly in the background, fading into the vastness.\n\n# Subjects Description\n<ID_A>:\n- *Gender*: Male.\n- *Race/Ethnicity*: East Asian.\n- *Age*: Middle-aged.\n- *Appearance features*: Wearing plain, loose-fitting ancient Hanfu robes in muted white and grey tones. Hair is tied back simply with a wooden hairpin. Facial expression is calm and contemplative. The fabric texture appears natural and slightly weathered.\n- *Vocal Characteristics*: None.\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nThe camera starts at a high-angle medium-wide shot, positioned above and behind <ID_A>, who stands motionless on the small wooden boat, facing away from the camera toward the horizon. <ID_A>'s wide sleeves and robe hem flutter gently in the sea breeze, fabric physics reacting to the wind direction. As the camera performs a slow, smooth crane-up and dolly-out movement, the frame expands rapidly. The boat shrinks in the frame, revealing the immense scale of the dark ocean surrounding it. Glowing mayfly particles drift past the lens in the foreground, creating parallax depth. The water surface ripples subtly, reflecting the Milky Way which appears to垂落 (hang down) into the sea. The mist thickens at the edges of the frame, enhancing the ink-wash aesthetic. The motion is steady and hypnotic, emphasizing the stillness of the figure against the moving cosmos.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\nVisual style blends photorealistic cinematic rendering with traditional Chinese ink wash painting aesthetics. Color palette is dominated by desaturated cold tones: deep navy, slate grey, and muted teal, punctuated by the soft white of the robes and the warm glow of the mayflies. Lighting is ethereal and volumetric, using fog to create depth layers. The image has a soft diffusion filter look to mimic the \"misty\" feel, avoiding harsh digital sharpness. High dynamic range preserves detail in both the dark water and bright stars.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\nThe atmosphere is profound, solitary, and philosophically melancholic. It evokes a sense of awe and humility, capturing the poetic sentiment of human transience against the eternal universe. The mood is quiet, meditative, and visually epic.",
